    "draft": true,
    "body": "This archive makes the Shan Hai Jing character work reviewable in GitHub: 29 youthful human–yokai identities, two-view transparent raster sheets, exact generation prompts, revision notes, and passage audits across all 18 chapters. It also recovers the earlier Cal study that was pending GitHub upload.\n\nThe original Shan Hai Jing R01 batch is retained as superseded history. The current candidates are not user-approved; the deployed character collection is unchanged. Two later R04 sheets correct physical yokai features. Two views on one raster sheet are not separate vector assets.\n\nSource snapshots: `17213fe23921222338821bbc6dd485ae3fb39cfd` and `d9b9e8d151eaff5a1b881389b4c5423d8d358b11`. Every uploaded blob SHA matched its local Git object, and each remote tree exactly matched the corresponding local snapshot tree. Initial archive contained 66 valid RGBA PNGs; the supplement added two correction PNGs.\n\nFigma synchronization has its own node-level confirmation and pending status in the manifest; GitHub archival does not establish Figma completion. Whole-book identity deduplication, disputed names and remaining anatomy checks are still pending. This PR does not claim the entire Shan Hai Jing artwork collection is complete.",
    "title": "Archive Shan Hai Jing youthful yokai candidates and full-book passage audits",
